{"text":"Now it has to be buried. Deep. In mud. Where the river floods. The mud at your door is frozen hard as rock. The only soft clay left is down at the crocodile's pool. The river is still running, grey and cold, with ice along the edges in the mornings. And the river has survivors of its own. A crocodile. Maybe the same one from day three. Crocodiles made it through the end of the world.","mood":"story","settings":{"stability":0.3,"style":0.6,"speed":1.1},"alignment":{"characters":["N","o","w"," ","i","t"," ","h","a","s"," ","t","o"," ","b","e"," ","b","u","r","i","e","d","."," ","D","e","e","p","."," ","I","n"," ","m","u","d","."," ","W","h","e","r","e"," ","t","h","e"," ","r","i","v","e","r"," ","f","l","o","o","d","s","."," ","T","h","e"," ","m","u","d"," ","a","t"," ","y","o","u","r"," ","d","o","o","r"," ","i","s"," ","f","r","o","z","e","n"," ","h","a","r","d"," ","a","s"," ","r","o","c","k","."," ","T","h","e"," ","o","n","l","y"," ","s","o","f","t"," ","c","l","a","y"," ","l","e","f","t"," ","i","s"," ","d","o","w","n"," ","a","t"," ","t","h","e"," ","c","r","o","c","o","d","i","l","e","'","s"," ","p","o","o","l","."," ","T","h","e"," ","r","i","v","e","r"," ","i","s"," ","s","t","i","l","l"," ","r","u","n","n","i","n","g",","," ","g","r","e","y"," ","a","n","d"," ","c","o","l","d",","," ","w","i","t","h"," ","i","c","e"," ","a","l","o","n","g"," ","t","h","e"," ","e","d","g","e","s"," ","i","n"," ","t","h","e"," ","m","o","r","n","i","n","g","s","."," ","A","n","d"," ","t","h","e"," ","r","i","v","e","r"," ","h","a","s"," ","s","u","r","v","i","v","o","r","s"," ","o","f"," ","i","t","s"," ","o","w","n","."," ","A"," ","c","r","o","c","o","d","i","l","e","."," ","M","a","y","b","e"," ","t","h","e"," ","s","a","m","e"," ","o","n","e"," ","f","r","o","m"," ","d","a","y"," ","t","h","r","e","e","."," ","C","r","o","c","o","d","i","l","e","s"," ","m","a","d","e"," ","i","t"," ","t","h","r","o","u","g","h"," ","t","h","e"," ","e","n","d"," ","o","f"," ","t",